      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, pretty clear. One thing though—I just ran it through the previewer and the \"academic density\" score came back way lower than I expected for a formal report. The department usually looks for a higher density to justify the publication tier.\n\nCan you try a second draft? You don't have to make it unreadable, but maybe try to incorporate more formal stratigraphic and temporal terminology to bring that score up a bit? Just keep it professional.",
